:: change character [nobr util]
<<set _newActiveCharacter = $activeCharacter>>
<div class='char-swap-boxes'>
  <<for _name, _object range $players[$activePlayer].characters>>
    <<characterbox _name true>>
  <</for>>
</div><br />
<<button 'cancel'>>
  <<goto 'main menu'>>
<</button>>
<<button 'confirm'>>
  <<set $activeCharacter = _newActiveCharacter>>
  <<set _gotoPassage = $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].lastPassage>>
  <<goto _gotoPassage>>
<</button>>